                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "We are facing an unprecedented health care crisis caused by Donald Trump and the House GOP \u2013 with ACA credits set to expire, 29,000 of our neighbors here in the 9th Congressional District will see their health care costs rise. A 60 year old couple from New Bedford earning $82,800 annually will see premiums rise by $14,694 or 238%. A family of four from Plymouth earning $129,800 will see costs rise by nearly $10,000. With $1 trillion in cuts to Medicaid in Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill set to impact an additional 24,179 residents of our district, we are in the midst of the largest cut to American healthcare in history, and that\u2019s why we are fighting back.",
